{% doc %}
  @prompt
    Create a brand new Shopify theme section called "Trust Bar" (file: sections/trust-bar.liquid).
    It is a thin horizontal strip of trust points that sits directly under the header or above the
    product form. Build it from scratch, do not reuse an existing section.
    
    CONTENT (4 default items, each an icon plus a short label)
    1. "In stock now"                  icon: availability dot (filled circle inside a ring)
    2. "Ships nationwide"              icon: delivery truck
    3. "Per-piece pricing"             icon: price tag
    4. "No membership, no minimum"     icon: checkmark in a circle
    Icons must be inline SVG, drawn in the section file, no icon font and no image uploads.
    Each icon has to visually match its label, do not use the same generic checkmark for all four.
    Stroke style, 1.5px stroke, currentColor, 20x20 viewBox, aria-hidden="true".
    
    DESKTOP (990px and up)
    - The whole row is centered horizontally in the page, not full-bleed stretched.
    - All 4 items sit in one static row, side by side, horizontally centered as a group.
    - No scrolling, no animation, no overflow on desktop.
    - Gap between items: 40px.
    - A thin vertical divider line between items, 1px wide, 16px tall, vertically centered.
      No divider after the last item.
    - Icon and label sit on one line, icon left, 8px gap, both vertically centered.
    - Label font size 15px, weight 500, letter-spacing 0.
    - Section vertical padding: 14px top, 14px bottom.
    
    TABLET (750px to 989px)
    - Same static centered row, gap reduced to 24px, label 14px.
    - If the 4 items do not fit, allow them to wrap onto a second centered line rather than overflow.
    
    MOBILE (749px and below) - this is the important part
    - All items stay on ONE single row that scrolls horizontally. Never stack, never wrap.
    - The row auto-scrolls continuously from right to left in a seamless marquee loop.
      Implement it by duplicating the item list twice inside the track and translating the track
      by -50% with a CSS keyframe animation, so the loop has no visible jump or gap.
    - Animation: linear, infinite, duration controlled by a theme setting (default 25s).
    - The track must also be swipeable by hand: use overflow-x auto with
      -webkit-overflow-scrolling touch, and pause the animation while the user is touching it.
    - Hide the scrollbar (scrollbar-width none, ::-webkit-scrollbar display none).
    - Item gap on mobile: 28px, with the same 1px vertical divider between items.
    - Label font size 13px, white-space nowrap on every label so nothing breaks mid-phrase.
    - Add a soft fade mask on the left and right edges, 24px wide, so items fade out instead of
      cutting off hard at the screen edge. Use mask-image linear-gradient, with a plain overflow
      fallback for browsers that do not support it.
    - Respect prefers-reduced-motion: when reduced motion is on, stop the auto-scroll entirely and
      leave the row as a plain manually swipeable strip.
    
    STYLE
    - Section background: white by default, settable.
    - Top and bottom 1px hairline border in #E3E8EF, each toggleable on or off.
    - Icon color: #1B7A3D
    - Label color: #1A1A1A
    - Divider color: #DCE2EA
    - Use the theme's existing body font stack, do not import a font.
    - No shadows, no rounded card, no gradient background. This is a flat strip, not a card.
    
    SCHEMA
    Blocks (type "trust_item", max 8, min 1), each with:
    - text: the label
    - select: icon, options = dot, truck, tag, check, shield, clock, box, refresh
      (draw a distinct inline SVG for every one of these options)
    Section settings:
    - color pickers: background, icon color, text color, divider color, border color
    - checkbox: show top border (default off)
    - checkbox: show bottom border (default on)
    - checkbox: enable auto scroll on mobile (default on)
    - range: scroll speed in seconds, 10 to 60, step 1, default 25
    - range: desktop gap in px, 16 to 64, step 4, default 40
    - checkbox: show dividers (default on)
    Add presets so the section can be dropped on any template, with the 4 default blocks above
    already filled in.
    
    ACCESSIBILITY AND CODE QUALITY
    - Wrap the items in a <ul>, one <li> per item, so it announces as a list.
    - All CSS scoped with the section id so multiple instances on one page do not collide.
    - CSS inside a {% stylesheet %} tag or a scoped <style> in the section, no external file.
    - No JavaScript libraries. If any JS is needed for the touch pause, keep it vanilla and inline.
    - Section must not cause horizontal scroll on the page body, only inside the track.
    
    Do not add a heading, do not add a button, do not make any item clickable.
{% enddoc %}
{% assign ai_gen_id = block.id | replace: '_', '' | downcase %}
{% style %}
  .trust-bar-{{ ai_gen_id }}{display:block;width:100%;background:{{ block.settings.background }};color:{{ block.settings.text_color }};border-top:{% if block.settings.show_top_border %}1px{% else %}0{% endif %} solid {{ block.settings.border_color }};border-bottom:{% if block.settings.show_bottom_border %}1px{% else %}0{% endif %} solid {{ block.settings.border_color }};overflow:hidden}
  .trust-bar-{{ ai_gen_id }}__viewport{width:100%;overflow:hidden}
  .trust-bar-{{ ai_gen_id }}__track{display:flex;width:max-content;margin:0 auto;padding:14px 0;align-items:center;gap:{{ block.settings.desktop_gap }}px}
  .trust-bar-{{ ai_gen_id }}__list{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:{{ block.settings.desktop_gap }}px;margin:0;padding:0;list-style:none}
  .trust-bar-{{ ai_gen_id }}__item{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;white-space:nowrap;font-size:15px;font-weight:500;letter-spacing:0;color:{{ block.settings.text_color }}}
  .trust-bar-{{ ai_gen_id }}__icon{display:inline-flex;width:20px;height:20px;flex:0 0 20px;color:{{ block.settings.icon_color }}}
  .trust-bar-{{ ai_gen_id }}__icon svg{width:20px;height:20px;stroke:currentColor;fill:none;stroke-width:1.5;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round}
  .trust-bar-{{ ai_gen_id }}__divider{width:1px;height:16px;flex:0 0 1px;background:{{ block.settings.divider_color }};{% unless block.settings.show_dividers %}display:none{% endunless %}}
  @media (min-width:750px) and (max-width:989px){.trust-bar-{{ ai_gen_id }}__track{max-width:100%;padding:14px 24px}.trust-bar-{{ ai_gen_id }}__list{flex-wrap:wrap;justify-content:center;gap:12px 24px}.trust-bar-{{ ai_gen_id }}__item{font-size:14px}.trust-bar-{{ ai_gen_id }}__list+ .trust-bar-{{ ai_gen_id }}__list{display:none}}
  @media (max-width:749px){.trust-bar-{{ ai_gen_id }}__viewport{overflow-x:auto;overflow-y:hidden;-webkit-overflow-scrolling:touch;scrollbar-width:none;mask-image:linear-gradient(to right,transparent,#000 24px,#000 calc(100% - 24px),transparent);-webkit-mask-image:linear-gradient(to right,transparent,#000 24px,#000 calc(100% - 24px),transparent)}.trust-bar-{{ ai_gen_id }}__viewport::-webkit-scrollbar{display:none}.trust-bar-{{ ai_gen_id }}__track{margin:0;padding:12px 24px;gap:28px;{% if block.settings.enable_auto_scroll %}animation:trust-marquee-{{ ai_gen_id }} {{ block.settings.scroll_speed }}s linear infinite{% endif %}}.trust-bar-{{ ai_gen_id }}__list{gap:28px}.trust-bar-{{ ai_gen_id }}__item{font-size:13px}.trust-bar-{{ ai_gen_id }}__list+ .trust-bar-{{ ai_gen_id }}__list{display:flex}}
  @keyframes trust-marquee-{{ ai_gen_id }}{from{transform:translateX(0)}to{transform:translateX(-50%)}}
  @media (prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.trust-bar-{{ ai_gen_id }}__track{animation:none!important}}
{% endstyle %}
<trust-bar-{{ ai_gen_id }} class="trust-bar-{{ ai_gen_id }}" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}><div class="trust-bar-{{ ai_gen_id }}__viewport"><div class="trust-bar-{{ ai_gen_id }}__track">{% for copy in (1..2) %}<ul class="trust-bar-{{ ai_gen_id }}__list" aria-label="Trust points">{% for i in (1..4) %}{% assign text_key='item_'|append:i|append:'_text' %}{% assign icon_key='item_'|append:i|append:'_icon' %}<li class="trust-bar-{{ ai_gen_id }}__item"><span class="trust-bar-{{ ai_gen_id }}__icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 20 20">{% case block.settings[icon_key] %}{% when 'dot' %}<circle cx="10" cy="10" r="6"/><circle cx="10" cy="10" r="2.5" fill="currentColor" stroke="none"/>{% when 'truck' %}<path d="M2.5 5.5h9v8h-9zM11.5 8h3l3 3v2.5h-6z"/><circle cx="6" cy="15" r="1.5"/><circle cx="15" cy="15" r="1.5"/>{% when 'tag' %}<path d="M3 3.5h7l7 7-6.5 6.5-7-7z"/><circle cx="7" cy="7.5" r="1"/>{% when 'check' %}<circle cx="10" cy="10" r="7"/><path d="m6.5 10 2.2 2.2 4.8-5"/>{% when 'shield' %}<path d="M10 2.5 16 5v4.5c0 4-2.4 6.7-6 8-3.6-1.3-6-4-6-8V5z"/>{% when 'clock' %}<circle cx="10" cy="10" r="7"/><path d="M10 6v4l2.8 1.8"/>{% when 'box' %}<path d="m3 6 7-3 7 3v8l-7 3-7-3zM3 6l7 3 7-3M10 9v8"/>{% when 'refresh' %}<path d="M16 7V3.5l-2.2 2.2A6.5 6.5 0 1 0 16.3 13"/><path d="M16 3.5h-3.5"/>{% endcase %}</svg></span><span>{{ block.settings[text_key] }}</span></li>{% unless i == 4 %}<li class="trust-bar-{{ ai_gen_id }}__divider" aria-hidden="true"></li>{% endunless %}{% endfor %}</ul>{% endfor %}</div></div></trust-bar-{{ ai_gen_id }}>
<script>(function(){var r=document.querySelector('trust-bar-{{ ai_gen_id }}'),v=r&&r.querySelector('.trust-bar-{{ ai_gen_id }}__viewport'),t=r&&r.querySelector('.trust-bar-{{ ai_gen_id }}__track');if(!v)return;v.addEventListener('pointerdown',function(){t.style.animationPlayState='paused'});['pointerup','pointercancel','pointerleave'].forEach(function(e){v.addEventListener(e,function(){t.style.animationPlayState='running'})})})();</script>
{% schema %}{"name":"Trust bar","settings":[{"type":"color","id":"background","label":"Background","default":"#FFFFFF"},{"type":"color","id":"icon_color","label":"Icon color","default":"#1B7A3D"},{"type":"color","id":"text_color","label":"Text color","default":"#1A1A1A"},{"type":"color","id":"divider_color","label":"Divider color","default":"#DCE2EA"},{"type":"color","id":"border_color","label":"Border color","default":"#E3E8EF"},{"type":"checkbox","id":"show_top_border","label":"Show top border","default":false},{"type":"checkbox","id":"show_bottom_border","label":"Show bottom border","default":true},{"type":"checkbox","id":"enable_auto_scroll","label":"Enable auto scroll on mobile","default":true},{"type":"range","id":"scroll_speed","label":"Scroll speed","min":10,"max":60,"step":1,"unit":"s","default":25},{"type":"range","id":"desktop_gap","label":"Desktop gap","min":16,"max":64,"step":4,"unit":"px","default":40},{"type":"checkbox","id":"show_dividers","label":"Show dividers","default":true},{"type":"header","content":"Trust points"},{"type":"text","id":"item_1_text","label":"Item 1 label","default":"In stock now"},{"type":"select","id":"item_1_icon","label":"Item 1 icon","options":[{"value":"dot","label":"Dot"},{"value":"truck","label":"Truck"},{"value":"tag","label":"Tag"},{"value":"check","label":"Check"},{"value":"shield","label":"Shield"},{"value":"clock","label":"Clock"},{"value":"box","label":"Box"},{"value":"refresh","label":"Refresh"}],"default":"dot"},{"type":"text","id":"item_2_text","label":"Item 2 label","default":"Ships nationwide"},{"type":"select","id":"item_2_icon","label":"Item 2 icon","options":[{"value":"dot","label":"Dot"},{"value":"truck","label":"Truck"},{"value":"tag","label":"Tag"},{"value":"check","label":"Check"},{"value":"shield","label":"Shield"},{"value":"clock","label":"Clock"},{"value":"box","label":"Box"},{"value":"refresh","label":"Refresh"}],"default":"truck"},{"type":"text","id":"item_3_text","label":"Item 3 label","default":"Per-piece pricing"},{"type":"select","id":"item_3_icon","label":"Item 3 icon","options":[{"value":"dot","label":"Dot"},{"value":"truck","label":"Truck"},{"value":"tag","label":"Tag"},{"value":"check","label":"Check"},{"value":"shield","label":"Shield"},{"value":"clock","label":"Clock"},{"value":"box","label":"Box"},{"value":"refresh","label":"Refresh"}],"default":"tag"},{"type":"text","id":"item_4_text","label":"Item 4 label","default":"No membership, no minimum"},{"type":"select","id":"item_4_icon","label":"Item 4 icon","options":[{"value":"dot","label":"Dot"},{"value":"truck","label":"Truck"},{"value":"tag","label":"Tag"},{"value":"check","label":"Check"},{"value":"shield","label":"Shield"},{"value":"clock","label":"Clock"},{"value":"box","label":"Box"},{"value":"refresh","label":"Refresh"}],"default":"check"}],"presets":[{"name":"Trust bar"}],"tag":null,"class":"trust-bar"}{% endschema %}